    <description>N96: Contact button. Plans and sends the monthly receipt of a finished month for this Contact only (MonthlyReceiptPlanAction, allDonors = false). Skipped when the Contact has no charge of that month waiting for a receipt. Gated by Manage_Charge_Schedule (also checked in Apex).</description>
